# Binaries are not versioned EXCEPT the two historical dexed helpers of the
# native mouse-association subsystem: they are build artifacts documented in
# docs/bluetooth-mouse-routing.md (§5), deliberately committed and pinned by
# SHA-256 in the commit that added them (3552194). They must stay tracked.
!runtime/termux/jvm/inputassoc.zip
